{"t":"Dworc Camp","s":"dworc-camp-d358b","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Dworc_Voodoomaster_94be3a.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Warning Icon Red\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"42\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Warning_Icon_Red_1eeb32.png\" width=\"50\"/></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure><p style=\"font-weight: bold;\">This article or section is about an event NPC, creature, item, object, outfit or location.</p><br/><p>The information about this NPC, <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">creature</a>, item, object, outfit or location is only relevant during a certain event or quest, e.g. only during Christmas.</p><p style=\"font-style:italic;font-size:x-small;\">Do not remove the information on this page because you can't find the NPC/creature/item/object/outfit/location.</p><p style=\"line-height:6pt;font-size:6pt;width:100%;text-align:right;\">discuss</p></div>\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Dworc Camp</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Dworc Voodoomaster\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dworc_Voodoomaster_94be3a.gif\" width=\"64\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Near city</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Port%20Hope\">Port Hope</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">South-west in <a href=\"#/wiki/Tiquanda\">Tiquanda</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32900,32792,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32900, 32792, 7)</a>.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"vocation\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation(s)</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">All vocations.</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">10.80<br/>July 21, 2015<br/>Summer Update 2015</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Dworc Camp</b> is a square area bordered by strands of Bamboo Fence and plants in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Tiquanda\">Tiquanda</a> jungle located <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32900,32792,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32900, 32792, 7)</a>, north of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Medusa%20Tower\">Medusa Tower</a>. It is one of many settlements of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Dworcs\">Dworcs</a>, who also perform some of their rituals here. You may come across their boss, <a href=\"#/wiki/Oodok%20Witchmaster\">Oodok Witchmaster</a>.\n</p><p>Sometimes, this camp won't be there and you will find a <a href=\"#/wiki/Hunter%20Camp\">Hunter Camp</a> instead. This is because these camps make up the <a href=\"#/quest/jungle-camp-mini-world-change\">Jungle Camp Mini World Change</a> together.\n</p><p>In the middle of the camp, you will be able to find a <a href=\"#/wiki/Pile%20of%20Bones%20%28Quest%29\">Pile of Bones (Quest)</a>. Use it to obtain the Dworc Misadventure (Book).\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dworc%20Venomsniper\"><img alt=\"Dworc Venomsniper\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dworc_Venomsniper_4f571d.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Dworc%20Venomsniper\">Dworc Venomsniper</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">35</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">80</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">17</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-13× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Leather%20Armor\">Leather Armor</a></li>\n<li>0-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Throwing%20Knife\">Throwing Knife</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Torch\">Torch</a></li>\n<li>0-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Arrow\">Poison Arrow</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Dagger\">Poison Dagger</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>0-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Skull%20%28Item%29\">Skull (Item)</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Tribal%20Mask\">Tribal Mask</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Seeds (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bronze%20Amulet\">Bronze Amulet</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bast%20Skirt\">Bast Skirt</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dworc%20Fleshhunter\"><img alt=\"Dworc Fleshhunter\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dworc_Fleshhunter_91feb8.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Dworc%20Fleshhunter\">Dworc Fleshhunter</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">40</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">85</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">41</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-13× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Leather%20Armor\">Leather Armor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cleaver\">Cleaver</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Torch\">Torch</a></li>\n<li>0-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Skull%20%28Item%29\">Skull (Item)</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Dagger\">Poison Dagger</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Hunting Spear (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Bone Shield (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Tribal%20Mask\">Tribal Mask</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Ripper Lance (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dworc%20Voodoomaster\"><img alt=\"Dworc Voodoomaster\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dworc_Voodoomaster_94be3a.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Dworc%20Voodoomaster\">Dworc Voodoomaster</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">55</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">80</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">90</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-17× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bone\">Bone</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a hre